The '''Glowing Mushroom Cave''' is a location in the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}}. It is the continuation of the [[Overgrown Mushroom Cave]] and it can be entered from {{Coordinates|244|54|-503}}.

{{ZoneText|Farm mushrooms.|Meet Moby.}}

After the addition of the {{NPCSprite|Moby}}, [[Glowing Mushroom]]s were added. Regular mushroom randomly will start to produce particles, indicating that they have become a Glowing Mushroom. Upon harvesting Glowing Mushrooms players will receive +1 (+2 with {{Item|Moby's Shears}}) Glowing Mushrooms in their inventory. These can then be traded with the NPC [[Moby]].

There is also a hidden room under a coarse dirt block at 175 43 -470 that can be entered after getting note from {{NPCSprite|Beth}} in {{Zone|The Garden}}.

== Location ==
The Glowing Mushroom Cave is a blueish cave found next to the [[Mushroom Gorge]] and the [[Overgrown Mushroom Cave]]. There are 2 small lakes inside as well as blue crystals hanging from the ceiling. The area has various [[Mushroom]] Trees as well as normal [[Mushrooms]] and it is one of the places where [[Mooshroom]]s can spawn.

